"A House of Healing treats injuries caused by superpowers."
"It usually has one healer, a superhuman or an Artonan, and an apprentice or two."
"It keeps a small handful of human nurses who train for years beyond normal nursing."
"Those consecrated nurses are granted authority to use certain healing wordchains."
"Healing there is soothing in a way a mundane hospital never is."
"Chicago has an Artonan House of Healing."
"Houses of Healing on the Triplanets have pediatric healers and rune-lit operating theaters."
"A severed limb recovered fast can be reattached there by healers and wizards with runes."
"Artonan doctors keep a gift bowl of small wrapped gifts for patients."
